      "instance_name": "home_security_system",
      "label": "Home Security System",
      "description": "A device or set of devices used to monitor and protect a residence from unauthorized entry or theft. The presence of such a system implies a concern for personal safety and property protection, which is a common real-world practice. The meme references this as a solution to 'thefts', which is a real-world problem.",
